Read numbers until the user enters zero

#!/bin/bash

number=1

while [ "$number" -ne 0 ]
do
    read -r -p "Enter a number (0 to exit): " number
    echo "You entered: $number"
done

echo "Program stopped."

read -r -> takes input from the user. The loop continues until the entered number is zero.

